{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04169","headline":"叙寄员半千 · 骆宾王","name":"叙寄员半千","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薄宦三河道，自负十余年。\n不应惊若厉，秪爲直如弦。\n坐历山川险，吁嗟陵谷迁。\n长吟空抱膝，短翮讵冲天。\n魂归沧海上，望断白云前。\n钓名劳拾紫，隐迹自谈玄。\n不学多能圣，徒思鸿宝仙。\n斯志良难已，此道岂徒然。\n嗟爲刀笔吏，耻从绳墨牵。\n岐路情虽狎，人伦地本偏。\n长揖谢时事，独往访林泉。\n寄言二三子，生死不来旋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}